msgid "No TTS engine available on this device.\n\nThe Android TTS helper (.dex) was not found at the expected path.\n\nPlease verify that tts_helper.dex exists inside the plugin's android/ folder.\n\nAs a workaround, install espeak-ng via Termux:\n  pkg install espeak-ng\n\nThen add Termux to your PATH before launching KOReader."
