msgid "No TTS engine found.\n\nVoice model files were found but the TTS binaries (espeak-ng, piper) are missing.\n\nPlease download the .zip file (audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip) from:\nhttps://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n\nDo not download 'Source code' -- it does not include the TTS engines.\n\nIf you already installed from the .zip, please generate a bug report from the plugin menu and post it on GitHub."
msgstr "未找到 TTS 引擎。\n\n找到了语音模型文件，但缺少 TTS 程序（espeak-ng、piper）。\n\n请从以下地址下载 .zip 文件（audiobook-koplugin-v*.zip）：\nhttps://github.com/stradichenko/audiobook.koplugin/releases/latest\n\n不要下载“Source code”——它不包含 TTS 引擎。\n\n如果你已从 .zip 安装，请从插件菜单生成错误报告并发布到 GitHub。"

