msgid "No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n\nPlease generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，音频需通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机。\n\n请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Audio needs Bluetooth headphones connected via Kindle Settings.\n\nThe Kindle audio subsystem did not expose a usable ALSA device. Please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue -- it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，音频需通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机。\n\nKindle 音频子系统未暴露可用的 ALSA 设备。请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nKindle has no built-in speaker. Please connect Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, then try again.\n\nIf you already have headphones connected, please generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub — it will help identify the correct audio path for this Kindle model."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKindle 没有内置扬声器，请通过 Kindle 设置连接蓝牙耳机后重试。\n\n若你已连接耳机，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub——这有助于确定此 Kindle 机型的正确音频路径。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nKobo has no built-in speaker.\n\nPlease pair Bluetooth headphones:\nSettings → Bluetooth → Pair\n\nThen try again."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\nKobo 没有内置扬声器。\n\n请配对蓝牙耳机：\n设置 → 蓝牙 → 配对\n\n然后重试。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nNo supported audio player found (aplay, paplay, mpv, mplayer).\n\nIf using Bluetooth, make sure headphones are paired and connected."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n未找到支持的音频播放器（aplay、paplay、mpv、mplayer）。\n\n若使用蓝牙，请确保耳机已完成配对并连接。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nNo working audio path was found on this PocketBook.\n\nTry changing the audio device:\nAudiobook > Audio device settings > System player (InkView)\n\nIf that does not help, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on GitHub."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n在此 PocketBook 上未找到可用的音频路径。\n\n尝试更改音频设备：\n有声书 > 音频设备设置 > 系统播放器（InkView）\n\n若无改善，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nOn this PocketBook, direct ALSA playback can damage the audio subsystem. Please connect Bluetooth headphones first, then try again."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n在此 PocketBook 上，直接 ALSA 播放可能损坏音频子系统。请先连接蓝牙耳机，再重试。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nThis Kindle has no built-in speaker, so audio must play over Bluetooth, and the plugin could not find a working audio route.\n\nTry this:\n1. Pair and connect Bluetooth headphones from the Kindle top-swipe menu (Settings), then start read-along again.\n2. If they are already connected, restart KOReader so the plugin re-detects the audio output.\n\nIf it still fails, generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此 Kindle 没有内置扬声器，音频必须经蓝牙播放，而插件未能找到可用的音频路由。\n\n请尝试：\n1. 从 Kindle 顶部下滑菜单（设置）配对并连接蓝牙耳机，再重新开始跟读。\n2. 若已连接，请重启 KOReader，让插件重新检测音频输出。\n\n若仍失败，请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nThis Kindle model has a built-in speaker, but no working audio device was found.\n\nPlease generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此 Kindle 机型有内置扬声器，但未找到可用的音频设备。\n\n请生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。"

msgid "No audio output available.\n\nThis device has no built-in speaker. Please connect a Bluetooth audio device first:\n\n1. Go to Audiobook > Bluetooth settings > Bluetooth\n2. Turn Bluetooth on\n3. Scan and pair your headphones/speaker\n4. Then start read-along again."
msgstr "没有可用的音频输出。\n\n此设备没有内置扬声器，请先连接蓝牙音频设备：\n\n1. 进入 有声书 > 蓝牙设置 > 蓝牙\n2. 开启蓝牙\n3. 扫描并配对你的耳机/音箱\n4. 然后重新开始跟读。"

msgid "No audio output device found.\n\nTTS synthesis will run but audio may not play. Start anyway?"
msgstr "未找到音频输出设备。\n\nTTS 合成会进行，但可能无声。仍要开始吗？"

