msgstr "VoxSherpa TTS"

msgid "When both files are downloaded, select 'sanoTTS-jp (Japanese)' under TTS engine."
msgstr "两个文件都下载完成后，在 TTS 引擎下选择“sanoTTS-jp（日语）”。"

msgid "When enabled (default), read-aloud pauses while a KOReader menu or dialog is open and resumes when it closes. When disabled, narration keeps playing while you browse menus; only the sentence highlighting pauses."
msgstr "启用（默认）时，朗读会在 KOReader 菜单或对话框打开期间暂停，关闭后继续。关闭时，浏览菜单期间旁白继续播放；仅句子高亮暂停。"

msgid "When enabled (default), the book view auto-turns to keep the current narration sentence on screen while you stay with the read-aloud. Manually turning a page never seeks or restarts audio: highlighting pauses and a “Return to read-aloud” cue appears until you jump back or the narration catches up."
msgstr "启用（默认）时，跟读期间书页视图自动翻页，使当前旁白句子保持在屏幕上。手动翻页不会跳转或重启音频：高亮暂停并显示“返回跟读”提示，直到你跳回或旁白追上。"

msgid "When enabled, TTS and playback audio are saved as WAV files in the audio/ folder. When disabled, only the video file is kept."
msgstr "启用后，TTS 与播放音频将以 WAV 文件保存在 audio/ 文件夹。关闭时仅保留视频文件。"

msgid "When enabled, closing the case/cover will not stop audio playback. When disabled (default), playback pauses on lid close and resumes when reopened. Disabling prevents device crashes caused by audio processes running during hardware suspend."
msgstr "启用后，合上保护壳/翻盖不会停止音频播放。关闭（默认）时，合盖暂停播放，重新打开后继续。关闭可防止音频进程在硬件挂起期间运行导致设备崩溃。"

msgid "When enabled, play/pause/next/prev buttons on a Bluetooth headset or speaker will control playback. The connected device will also show playback status.\n\nOn Kindle, stem clicks are read from Lab126 LIPC (playermgr / audiomgrd) because this firmware has no AVRCP evdev node."
msgstr "启用后，蓝牙耳机或音箱上的播放/暂停/上一首/下一首按键将控制播放，连接设备也会显示播放状态。\n\n在 Kindle 上，按键事件通过 Lab126 LIPC（playermgr / audiomgrd）读取，因为此固件没有 AVRCP evdev 节点。"

msgid "When enabled, the device will suspend after the sleep timer stops playback."
msgstr "启用后，睡眠定时器停止播放后设备将挂起。"

msgid "When enabled, the mini audiobook bar stays on screen after you stop narration. When disabled (default), the bar hides when idle."
msgstr "启用后，迷你有声书栏在停止旁白后仍留在屏幕上。关闭（默认）时，空闲时该栏隐藏。"

msgid "When enabled, the minimized read-aloud mini player sits above KOReader’s bottom status bar / progress bar (alt status bar at the top is unchanged). The page always reflows so book text ends above the mini player — the player never covers readable text. When disabled (default), the mini player sits at the bottom of the screen (may cover the status bar) but text is still reflowed above it."
msgstr "启用后，最小化的跟读迷你播放器位于 KOReader 底部状态栏/进度条之上（顶部备用状态栏不变）。页面始终重排，使书文结束于迷你播放器之上——播放器绝不遮挡可读文字。关闭（默认）时，迷你播放器位于屏幕底部（可能遮挡状态栏），但文字仍重排于其上方。"

msgid "When enabled, the plugin writes this book’s bottom page margin into KOReader’s own settings before CRE typesets. The next open rebuilds the layout once (text stays above the audiobook bar); after that, KOReader reuses that layout. Disable to restore your original margins and edit them with KOReader’s usual controls."
msgstr "启用后，插件在 CRE 排版前将此书的底部页边距写入 KOReader 自身设置。下次打开会重建一次版式（文字位于有声书栏之上）；之后 KOReader 复用该版式。关闭可恢复你的原始页边距并用 KOReader 常规控件调整。"

msgid "When enabled, the progress bar row is left out of the control bar during TTS read-along, making the bar one row shorter and leaving more of the page visible. The sentence highlight already shows how far along the page you are. The progress bar is always shown for audiobook playback, where it doubles as the seek control."
msgstr "启用后，跟读控制栏中不含进度条一行，使控制栏减少一行、露出更多页面内容。句子高亮已能显示当前进度。有声书播放时进度条始终显示，并兼作拖动定位控件。"

msgid "When enabled, the recorder tries to mux ALSA audio into the video file in real time. This requires a working ALSA capture device and fails on most e-ink devices, so it is disabled."
msgstr "启用后，录制器会尝试将 ALSA 音频实时混入视频文件。这需要可用的 ALSA 采集设备，在大多数墨水屏设备上会失败，因此默认关闭。"

msgid "Whisper (female)"
msgstr "低语（女）"

msgid "Whisper"
msgstr "低语"

msgid "Word gap (between words): %1"
msgstr "词间隔（词与词之间）：%1"

msgid "Workaround for Android devices where read-aloud audio cuts off mid-sentence and stalls (seen on some MTK e-readers). Plays synthesized audio through one persistent, continuously-fed audio track instead of a fresh media player per sentence. Leave this off for neural engines such as SherpaTTS: the persistent stream adds hiss and pitch artifacts. Off by default; the plugin also switches to it automatically for the rest of the session when it detects a stalled clip, except on neural engines. Takes effect from the next sentence."
msgstr "针对部分 Android 设备朗读音频在句中中断并卡住的 workaround（见于某些 MTK 电子书阅读器）。通过一条持续供音的音频轨道播放合成音频，而非每句新建媒体播放器。神经语音引擎（如 SherpaTTS）请保持关闭：持续流会引入嘶嘶声和音高失真。默认关闭；插件在检测到音频片段卡住时（神经引擎除外）也会在本会话剩余时间自动切换至此。从下一句起生效。"

msgid "\n\nConnect your device via USB to retrieve the file. Please share it when reporting issues on GitHub."
msgstr "\n\n请通过 USB 连接设备以获取该文件。上报问题时请将其分享到 GitHub。"

msgid "\n\nConnect your device via USB to retrieve the file. Share it on GitHub to help document device performance."
msgstr "\n\n请通过 USB 连接设备以获取该文件，并分享到 GitHub，帮助我们记录设备性能表现。"

msgid "\n\nError output:\n"
msgstr "\n\n错误输出：\n"

msgid "\n\nFor this read-aloud EPUB, use \"Play aligned audiobook from here\"."
msgstr "\n\n对于这本支持朗读的 EPUB，请使用“从此处播放已对齐的有声书”。"

msgid "\n\nIt is now selected as your active MBROLA voice."
msgstr "\n\n它现在已被选为你的 MBROLA 语音。"

msgid "\n\nIt is now selected as your active Piper voice."
msgstr "\n\n它现在已被选为你的 Piper 语音。"

msgid "\n\nOpen the Bluetooth menu to connect."
msgstr "\n\n请打开蓝牙菜单进行连接。"

msgid "\n\nThis book has embedded narration — use \"Play aligned audiobook from here\" instead."
msgstr "这本图书已内嵌旁白，请改用“从此处播放已对齐的有声书”。"

msgid "\n\nThis is often a system library compatibility issue. Try connecting Bluetooth headphones via Kindle Settings, switch to the espeak backend (Tools → Audiobook → Voice settings → TTS engine), or generate a bug report (Audiobook > Generate bug report) and share it on the GitHub issue."
msgstr "\n\n这通常是系统库兼容性问题。请尝试在 Kindle 设置中连接蓝牙耳机、切换到 espeak 后端（工具 → 有声书 → 语音设置 → TTS 引擎），或生成错误报告（有声书 > 生成错误报告）并分享到 GitHub 问题页。"

